  "description": "On the day he failed the interview, Woo Kang-han received a phone call. A strange call offering to personally re-enable a re-interview... That day, Kang Han signs a private contract with Chae Shin-young. Annual salary of 200 million won, an officetel, and a luxury foreign car are provided. What I have to do under those conditions is... A special sex between the two of them...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746011446), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/jaedam_sr_0101), [Comcio](https://www.comico.kr/comic/2528), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/2798)",
